[statement]
A name every candidate for a required name depends on is required as soon
as that name is: `p1` and `p2`, the candidates for `v`, both depend on the
real `kw`, which is installed before `w` is decided, though `app` lists `w`
first; `kw` provides `w`, so `gk` is not installed.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:w v

P:p1
V:1
p:v
k:100
D:kw

P:p2
V:1
p:v
k:10
D:kw

P:kw
V:1
p:w

P:gk
V:1
p:w
k:100

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install kw 1
install p1 1
install app 1
